<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>document<sp/>provides<sp/>a<sp/>comparative<sp/>analysis<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>three<sp/>primary<sp/>hydraulic<sp/>erosion<sp/>approaches<sp/>implemented<sp/>in<sp/>HighMap:</highlight></codeline>
